      "body": "## Overview\nAdds AWQ-v2 quantization format support with 64KB direct GPU DMA page-aligned weights and pre-swizzled Marlin 16x64 INT4 tensor core tile layouts to eliminate host CPU un-packing and repacking latencies during model loading. Link to spec: AWQ_V2_SPECIFICATION.md.\n\n## Claims\n- **Direct GPU DMA Mapping:** 64KB alignment guarantees raw tensor offsets match hardware virtual memory page boundaries, allowing zero-copy direct NVMe-to-VRAM transfers.\n- **Eliminates Host CPU Repack:** Pre-swizzles weights into Marlin cooperative matrix layouts at quantization time rather than spending 15-45 seconds dynamically repacking nibbles on host CPU cores during engine initialization.\n- **Full Backward Compatibility:** Falls back transparently to standard AWQ v1 decompression when reading legacy v1 checkpoints.\n\n## Validation\n- Validated via AWQ_V2_LOADER.py standalone zero-repack verification harness.\n- Verified tensor offset alignment at ",
